      "description": "First vulnerability-relevant project parser statement. It reads the attacker-controlled `fvar` header into local fields, including the font's named-instance count, and the valid-header path immediately below sets `face->variation_support |= TT_FACE_FLAG_VAR_FVAR`."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "r_cff_suppression_does_not_reduce_named_instance_count_on_truetype_path",
      "role": "root_cause",
