      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_coords_write_sink_uses_discarded_namedstyle",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer crash site. After the named-instance loop advances past the initialized `mmvar->namedstyle[]` entries, `c` holds a bogus destination pointer read from non-`coords` bytes, and this assignment writes through it."
